<title>USA: Horizon Financial declares stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Horizon Financial declares stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>BELLINGHAM, Wash. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-chartered bank holding company Horizon Financial Corp said Wednesday its board had declared a 15 percent stock dividend, payable May 29, record May 8.</p>
